  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Requests one `HTTP://` [](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/File:Wikipedia-16px.png)&#8201;<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/URL" target="_blank">URL</a> for use by this <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Script" target="_blank">script</a>. The <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Http_request" target="_blank">http_request</a> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Event" target="_blank">event</a> is triggered with the result of the request.</p>
  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Key/handle" target="_blank">handle</a> (a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Key" target="_blank">key</a>) used for identifying the result of the request in the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Http_request" target="_blank">http_request</a> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Event" target="_blank">event</a>.</p>
</p>
    </div>

